{"type":"message","id":"df7446d2","parentId":"c3342fac","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:57:22.440Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I’ve set up the initial project files for the **Meta Description SERP Snippet Preview** feature:\n\n1. **Documentation**:\n   - Created `README.md` outlining the goals, features, and workflow.\n\n2. **Basic Project Initialization**:\n   - Added `package.json` with essential dependencies like `express` (backend) and `jest` (testing).\n\n3. **Initial Backend Setup**:\n   - Started the Express.js app and initialized the `/analyze` endpoint as a placeholder for AI integration and dynamic updates.\n\nNext, I will:\n\n- Add test cases (using Jest) to support TDD.\n- Implement backend logic to process metadata snippets dynamically and validate SEO alignment. \n- Set up the frontend for real-time snippet preview updates."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":398,"output":155,"cacheRead":6912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7465,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770915440224}}
